        "prompt": "Classify the causes of Abnormal Uterine Bleeding using the FIGO PALM-COEIN system.",
        "model_answer": "Structural causes (PALM): Polyp (AUB-P), Adenomyosis (AUB-A), Leiomyoma (AUB-L: submucosal vs others), Malignancy & hyperplasia (AUB-M). Non-structural causes (COEIN): Coagulopathy (AUB-C: e.g. von Willebrand disease), Ovulatory dysfunction (AUB-O: e.g. PCOS, perimenopause), Endometrial (AUB-E: primary disorders of local endometrial hemostasis), Iatrogenic (AUB-I: IUDs, anticoagulants), Not otherwise classified (AUB-N).",
